MIT License

Applies to the DUN boundary GeoJSON files in this directory
(<State>.geojson x13), derived from:

  https://github.com/atifmustaffa/malaysia-geojson
  malaysia.dun.geojson (master branch, downloaded 2026-08-29)

Copyright (c) 2026 Atif Mustaffa — MIT Licence (verified via the repo's
LICENSE file and the GitHub licence API on 2026-08-29).

Modifications made by the HitungKerusi 222 project (29 Aug 2026):
- Split the national file into 13 per-state files.
- Normalised seat-name spellings to match the project's election results
  CSVs (Sabah N.22 'Tanjong Aru' -> 'Tanjung Aru'; Sarawak N.81
  'Ba`Kelalan' -> "Ba'kelalan").
- Excluded 13 federal-territory placeholder features (no DUN code).

